<title>USA: GAF Corp 's G-I Holdings Q3 net up after gain.</title>
<headline>GAF Corp 's G-I Holdings Q3 net up after gain.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, N.J. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		    1995</p>
<p> Net			$54,100		   11,800</p>
<p> Sales		    410,700		  347,500</p>
<p>					 9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Net			 69,800		   25,900</p>
<p> Sales		  1,153,600		1,002,100</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>The third quarter included a gain of $43.6 million (net of income tax) from the sale of the company's radio broadcasting assets.</p>
